<title>USA: Interstate/Johnson Lane Inc Q4 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Interstate/Johnson Lane Inc Q4 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the three months ended  For the year ended</p>
<p>		    9/30/96     9/30/95     9/30/96	9/30/95</p>
<p>Total Revenues</p>
<p>		$50,176,232 $50,713,885 $208,754,728 $184,200,514</p>
<p> Net Income   2,184,715   2,034,828    9,354,624    5,928,392</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share:</p>
<p>  Primary	    0.37	  0.33	   1.55	   0.94</p>
<p>  Fully Diluted    0.33	  0.31	   1.36	   0.91</p>
<p>Weighted Average Shares:</p>
<p>  Primary     5,931,653   6,146,942    6,040,349    6,304,415</p>
<p>Fully Diluted</p>
<p>		  7,455,248   7,430,647    7,563,944    7,582,565</p>
<p>NOTE: The FY96 earnings figure reflects restated earnings figures for the first, second and third primary earnings per share for these quarters were restated to $0.34 cents, $0.46 cents and $0.38 to reflect adoption of a long-term equity incentive program retroactive to the beginning of the 1996 fiscal year.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
